Phase 1: Fundamentals (Must Do First)
Learn these concepts deeply:
🔹 Core Concepts

Scalability (vertical vs horizontal)
Load balancing
Caching (Redis, CDN)
Database types:

SQL (MySQL, PostgreSQL)
NoSQL (MongoDB, Cassandra)


CAP Theorem (Consistency vs Availability)
Latency vs Throughput

🔹 Must Know Components

API Gateway
Microservices vs monolith
Message queues (Kafka, RabbitMQ)
CDN
Rate limiting
Authentication (JWT, OAuth)
======================================
🟢 Beginner-Level Questions (Must Start Here)
These test basic architecture + core concepts

Design a URL Shortener (like bit.ly)
Design a Rate Limiter
Design a Pastebin
Design a File Storage System (like Google Drive basic)
Design a Parking Lot System
Design a Key-Value Store (like Redis basic)

👉 Focus: APIs, DB schema, caching, scaling basics

🟡 Intermediate-Level Questions
These are most common in interviews
Social + Communication Systems

Design WhatsApp / Chat System
Design a Notification System
Design Instagram / Facebook Feed
Design Twitter Timeline

Core Platform Systems

Design a Web Crawler
Design Search Autocomplete (Google)
Design a Distributed Cache
Design an API Rate Limiter for large-scale apps

Media & Storage

Design Dropbox
Design YouTube basic (video upload + streaming)

👉 Focus: real-time systems, queues, caching, scalability

🔴 Advanced-Level Questions (Top Companies)
These test deep system thinking + trade-offs
Large-Scale Systems

Design Netflix / Video Streaming Platform
Design Uber / Ola (ride matching system)
Design Google Maps (routing system)
Design Amazon / E-commerce platform
Design LinkedIn

Distributed Systems

Design a Distributed Logging System
Design Google Docs (real-time collaboration)
Design a Distributed Job Scheduler
Design a Scalable Calendar System

👉 Focus: partitioning, consistency, fault tolerance

🎯 High-Frequency Interview Questions (Very Important)
If you're short on time, prioritize these:
✅ URL Shortener
✅ Chat System
✅ News Feed
✅ Rate Limiter
✅ Notification System
✅ Uber / Ride Matching
✅ YouTube / Streaming
